{"cues":[{"sectionId":"languages","start":0,"end":88.32},{"sectionId":"structure","start":88.48,"end":167.76},{"sectionId":"check","start":168.16,"end":222.4}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"languages","start":0,"end":1.28,"text":"各位同學大家好，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":1.44,"end":2.96,"text":"歡迎來到 Methelia。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":3.68,"end":7.84,"text":"今天我們要一起完成一個有標題、介紹文字，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":8.107,"end":12.24,"text":"而且按下按鈕就會改變標題的個人首頁。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":12.68,"end":14.88,"text":"你不需要先會寫程式，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":15.12,"end":17.6,"text":"我們會從看懂畫面開始，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":17.72,"end":20.08,"text":"再一步一步修改真正的檔案。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":21.04,"end":23.76,"text":"早期的網頁主要用來分享文件；"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":24.32,"end":28.88,"text":"今天的網頁還能呈現設計、回應使用者操作。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":29.6,"end":30.16,"text":"因此，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":30.2,"end":36.08,"text":"我們先把網站拆成三件事：放什麼內容、看起來怎麼樣，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":36.453,"end":39.28,"text":"以及操作之後發生什麼事。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":40.08,"end":43.32,"text":"請看畫面上的標題和按鈕。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":43.76,"end":47.28,"text":"HTML 負責定義這些內容和結構；"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":48.08,"end":51.92,"text":"CSS 決定顏色、大小與間距；"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":52.72,"end":56,"text":"JavaScript 則負責點擊以後的反應。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":56.88,"end":58.88,"text":"現在切到 CSS，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":59.28,"end":60.96,"text":"選一個按鈕顏色。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":61.36,"end":63.52,"text":"你會發現外觀變了，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":63.92,"end":65.6,"text":"文字仍然相同。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":66.4,"end":67.92,"text":"再切到 JavaScript，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":68.24,"end":69.48,"text":"按下按鈕，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":69.68,"end":72.48,"text":"觀察畫面上的文字如何改變。"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":73.44,"end":75.52,"text":"重點不是背下三個名字，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":75.76,"end":80.64,"text":"而是能判斷：我想改的究竟是內容、外觀，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":80.96,"end":82.16,"text":"還是行為？"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":83.04,"end":84.96,"text":"這頁播完會停下來，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":85.28,"end":87.04,"text":"請你親手比較一次，"},{"sectionId":"languages","start":87.28,"end":88.32,"text":"再按下一頁。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":88.48,"end":91.76,"text":"剛才我們從畫面認識了三種語言。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":92,"end":92.72,"text":"接下來，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":92.96,"end":96.336,"text":"老師帶你把畫面和 HTML 程式碼連起來。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":96.336,"end":103.2,"text":"HTML 使用標籤告訴瀏覽器每一段內容的角色。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":103.36,"end":106,"text":"h1 表示主要標題，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":106.24,"end":107.2,"text":"p 表示段落，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":107.44,"end":109.76,"text":"button 表示按鈕。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":110.32,"end":112.32,"text":"請先點選畫面上的 h1，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":112.72,"end":114.52,"text":"找出它對應的標題。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":114.72,"end":118.96,"text":"接著觀看示範：打開 index."},{"sectionId":"structure","start":119.12,"end":120.4,"text":"html，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":120.72,"end":122.272,"text":"找到「我的第一個網站」，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":122.72,"end":128.587,"text":"只把這段文字換成 Hello Methelia，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":128.68,"end":129.28,"text":"左右的標籤保留。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":129.36,"end":133.96,"text":"你要注意兩件事：標籤告訴瀏覽器它是標題，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":134.24,"end":139.6,"text":"而標籤中間的文字才是讀者實際看到的內容。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":140,"end":141.92,"text":"所以修改文字後，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":142.08,"end":144.12,"text":"標題的內容會變，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":144.4,"end":147.72,"text":"但我們沒有因此修改按鈕的顏色，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":148.08,"end":150.4,"text":"也沒有加入新的點擊行為。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":150.88,"end":152.64,"text":"這次先看懂示範；"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":152.92,"end":158.8,"text":"下一章會讓你在自己的檔案裡完成同樣的修改。"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":159.04,"end":160.48,"text":"頁面停下來後，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":160.76,"end":165.12,"text":"可以再點選 p 和 button，"},{"sectionId":"structure","start":165.44,"end":167.76,"text":"確認它們各自對應到哪一個元素。"},{"sectionId":"check","start":168.16,"end":169.52,"text":"現在換你判斷。"},{"sectionId":"check","start":169.76,"end":174.08,"text":"假設我們想把紫色按鈕改成綠色，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":174.4,"end":177.2,"text":"按鈕上的文字保持一樣，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":177.44,"end":180.24,"text":"按下去的反應也保持一樣。"},{"sectionId":"check","start":180.48,"end":182.8,"text":"你會修改哪一種語言？"},{"sectionId":"check","start":183,"end":184.56,"text":"先別急著選，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":184.8,"end":191.04,"text":"請用剛才的方法把需求分類：這是在改內容、外觀，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":191.28,"end":192.72,"text":"還是行為？"},{"sectionId":"check","start":192.88,"end":193.92,"text":"選好之後，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":194.32,"end":198.4,"text":"再讀一下系統提供的解釋，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":198.72,"end":200.4,"text":"確認自己的理由，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":200.64,"end":203.067,"text":"而不只是看有沒有答對。"},{"sectionId":"check","start":203.2,"end":205.28,"text":"這一章的學習目標，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":205.44,"end":210.64,"text":"就是能從一個具體需求找到正確的修改方向。"},{"sectionId":"check","start":210.88,"end":212.96,"text":"這頁結束會暫停，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":213.2,"end":214.4,"text":"留給你作答。"},{"sectionId":"check","start":215.04,"end":215.68,"text":"完成後，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":215.92,"end":219.44,"text":"我們進入 HTML 章節，"},{"sectionId":"check","start":219.84,"end":222.4,"text":"開始修改個人首頁真正的標題。"}]}